# Commit message template for MapleSpike
#
# Every commit MUST reference the issue number:
#   feat: add IRCC immigration module (#42)
#   fix: resolve NPE in pipeline-core parser (#107)
#   docs: update AGENTS.md workflow section (#203)
#
# Allowed prefixes:
#   feat:     New feature or module
#   fix:      Bug fix
#   docs:     Documentation only
#   refactor: Code restructuring with no behavior change
#   test:     Adding or updating tests
#   chore:    Build, CI, dependencies, templates
#   perf:     Performance improvement
#
# First line: 72 chars max. Body: wrap at 72 chars.
# Body is optional but recommended for complex changes.
#
# Example:
#   feat: implement OWASP compliance dashboard (#123)
#
#   Adds a Grafana dashboard for OWASP Top 10 security monitoring
#   with real-time alerting on data freshness violations.
#
#   Closes #123